+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm for the authentication system. It was chosen for its memory-hard design and side-channel resistance, which give stronger protection against GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks. This decision was recorded on 2026-09-26, and no later decision has changed it.
